  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Instrumento marco de cooperaci&#xf3;n M&#xe9;xico - Uni&#xf3;n Europea para el Desarrollo en Transici&#xf3;n</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objective is on both the dialogue and the common EU-Mexico COVID response, not on specific projects. Pilot projects will help both to explore innovative alternatives for implementing the jointly defined agenda and to support Mexico&#xbf;s efforts against the effects of the COVID-19 pandemic. Not focusing on specific impacts, but on enhancing bi-lateral engagement, the Fund aims to reinforce our partnership not only locally, but also at regional and global level.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
